<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0659_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What? I can’t hear you real good.\nI think the connection trash.\rWell, if you got somethin’ you wanna\ntalk to me about, go somewhere else\fand try callin’ again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Wassup...\nOh, hi, how you doin’?\fI’m fine, thanks.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, there’s Block Bosses out\nthere stronger than me.\fYou should try scrappin’ ’em.\fI don’t think you’d lose.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I usually get up real early...\nIf we gon’ scrap, I’m at my best\fin the mornin’... How ’bout you give\fme a call Monday mornin’!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, perfect timin’!\nI was gettin’ bored...\fYou wanna scrap again? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Honesty is good.\rSo, I’ll meet you at\nthe Saffron Dojo, then?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I see. Well, that’s how it’s gotta\nbe...\rIf you ever change your mind, gimme\na call.\rRemember, I’m free Monday mornings.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hmm. You deadass got time to\nscrap me right now?\rIf you got plans with other people,\nhandle those first,\fdon’t you think?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aight, I’ll see you at\nthe Saffron Dojo.\fI won’t be late. Don’t worry!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yes, this Pryce.\nHow you doin’?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We made plans to scrap at\nthe Saffron Dojo.\fYou ain’t forget, did you?\fI’m waitin’ there for you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Just like one of my kids...\rNo.\rYou more like one of my\ngrandkids...\rThere’s such a age gap between\nme and the Hustlers who beat me\fthese days...\rBut you know, the weird thing is\nwhen I lose, I ain’t disappointed.\rI just feel happy.\rJust happy such talented Hustlers\ncame to see me.\r...I just wanted to talk to somebody\nabout that, so I called you.\rThat’s all.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know why they call me the winter\nHustler? You remember my middle\fname is “Willow”?\rThe willow tree look like it wither in\nwinter’s cold. But deadass, it sprout\fdozens of new buds.\rMy fightin’ style strong just\nlike that...\rIt’s in old books, you know.\nLook it up sometime.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0659_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That reminds me, you kept The Feds’\nfederal overreach in check, right?\rHumph...\nThat’s a praiseworthy deed and\fthe right move for a Hustler\fwho could beat me.\rI think there’s still a few things I\ncould learn from you.\rI’m lookin’ forward to it.</language>
	</row>
</body>
